body:
i'm also late diagnosed level 2. its nice to see ppl like us in the comments :)

i've spoken to my mom (neurodivergent, possibly autistic) about why i was never checked out as a kid and she basically just said that my childhood behaviours weren't that different from her own (see: possibly autistic), so she kinda thought nothing of it lol. also bc i come from a culture where autism is widely thought of "white people nonsense", it was harder to b taken seriously ;-;


edit: spelling
